{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"textDocument/didOpen","params":{"textDocument":{"uri":"file:///tmp/VOID%20documentation%20%C3%A9%F0%9F%98%80%20uzwov069/api.void","languageId":"void","version":7,"text":"## Save plain_name <value> é😀.\n## Mention @param inline inside ordinary prose.\n## @param name Unsaved name é😀.\n## @param last Last payload.\n## @return Saved value.\nfunc save(name: string, middle: i32 = 1, last: i32 = 2) -> i32:\n    return middle + last\n## @param wrong Unknown name.\nfunc no_docs(first: i32, second: i32) -> i32:\n    return first + second\n## @param value Generic payload.\nfunc unused<t>(value: t, missing: t) -> t:\n    return value\n## @param value\n## @param value First nonempty.\n## @param value Later ignored.\n## @return\n## @return First return.\n## @return Later ignored.\nfunc duplicate(value: i32) -> i32:\n    return value\n"}}}Content-Length: 49

